[ext_resource type="PackedScene" uid="uid://d0uq0x2m2q0c6" path="res://scenes/note.tscn" id="2_note_scene"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_item_data")
item_name = "Arvid's Note"
item_description = "A note in Arvid Stenberg's handwriting, left by the terminal."
item_type = 1
note_text = "\"2 April — 22:14

Still no signal. The office swears the mast down by the main road was upgraded last month. Funny how the network only ever works when they want something from me.

There's a sound coming out of the sunken tunnel at night. From the porch it's just wind in the metal — but the pitch shifts match the clicks I recorded at Nest Gamma. Not roughly. Exactly. Whatever lives in those stumps learned that sound from something, and tonight that something is down in the tunnel.

If the office reads this before anyone else does: I went down to take a manual sound sample. That's all.

Left the terminal running. Taking the spare battery cells. Back within the hour.

— Arvid\""
read_thought = "\"Back within the hour.\" Then why did they need to send me?"
scene_to_spawn = ExtResource("2_note_scene")
